    "answer": {
      "short": "2DL",
      "worked": "Convert all probabilities to decimals.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{rain reported by 2AT}) &= 0.53 \\\\ P(\\text{rain reported by 2BW}) &= \\frac{17}{100}=0.17 \\\\ P(\\text{rain reported by 2CZ}) &= \\frac{13}{25}=0.52 \\\\ P(\\text{rain reported by 2DL}) &= 0.6.\\end{align*}$$\n2DL has the highest probability, since $0.6>0.53>0.52>0.17$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
